# @tripician/graphics (icons, colours, doodle settings) comes from the org's
# private GitHub Packages registry; everything else still comes from npmjs.
#
# GITHUB_PACKAGES_TOKEN is a GitHub classic token with only read:packages.
# Set it as a user environment variable on your machine and in each Vercel
# project's Environment Variables (Production, Preview, Development). This
# file holds no secret, only the variable's name.
#
# Not NPM_TOKEN: Vercel reserves that name for registry.npmjs.org and builds
# its own .npmrc from it, so the token never reached GitHub (401 on install).
@tripician:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_PACKAGES_TOKEN}
